# Source of truth

- Implement [`CODING_AGENT_MASTER_PROMPT.md`](CODING_AGENT_MASTER_PROMPT.md). Ignore [`MASTER_PROJECT_PROMPT.md`](MASTER_PROJECT_PROMPT.md) except as archive.
- Do not invent business rules, government APIs, schemas, credentials, or legal judgments.
- Do not redesign the workflow. Do not skip stages. Do not implement later stages until the current stage is tested and accepted.
- Prototype data is **synthetic only**. Label it synthetic. Never claim it is real legal status or real government records.
- If a technical detail is unspecified: isolate it in config, document the assumption, or **ask** — do not invent a new business rule.
- First implementation (when coding is authorized): Phase 1 structure + Phase 2 synthetic generators + tests on the **server**, then **STOP**. Do not start GeoAI Stage 1 until that is accepted. Do not implement the client.

# Do not use from the old brief

GNSS star-topology snapping, zoning 10/15/50 cm traffic lights, ULPIN auto-generation, SAM/YOLOv8-seg as the production model, `PENDING_SURVEY`, or treating cadastral/legacy maps as snap-to-GNSS Priority 3.
